          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1409,
          "text": "这里是赛事讨论组，所有参加锦标赛的选手都在哦",
          "next": [
            145400001
          ]
        },
        "145400001": {
          "id": 145400001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1409,
          "text": "灰宝，和大家打个招呼吧",
          "next": [
            145400002,
            145400005
          ]
        },
        "145400002": {
          "id": 145400002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "奇美拉对战，实力说话",
          "next": [
            145400003
          ]
        },
        "145400003": {
          "id": 145400003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我将击败你们，证明自己是翁法罗斯第一训练家",
          "next": [
            145400004
          ]
        },
        "145400004": {
          "id": 145400004,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "next": [
            145400008
          ]
        },
        "145400005": {
          "id": 145400005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我才刚打完定级赛，还是个新人",
          "next": [
            145400006
          ]
        },
        "145400006": {
          "id": 145400006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "各位，下手轻点",
          "next": [
            145400007
          ]
        },
        "145400007": {
          "id": 145400007,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "next": [
            145400008
          ]
        },
        "145400008": {
          "id": 145400008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "好搭档，难得有和你碰面的机会，这次，让我们用各自的奇美拉一决高下吧！",
          "next": [
            145400009
          ]
        },
        "145400009": {
          "id": 145400009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "哼，可别输得太惨啊，救世主",
          "next": [
            145400022
          ]
        },
        "145400010": {
          "id": 145400010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "想阻挡我的征途？呵，看你是否有这个实力吧",
          "next": [
            145400011
          ]
        },
        "145400011": {
          "id": 145400011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "无妨，我会扫清凯撒前方的一切障碍",
          "next": [
            145400012
          ]
        },
        "145400012": {
          "id": 145400012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1406,
          "text": "嗨，灰子，做个交易怎么样？我替你偷走对面的奇美拉，你故意放水输给我",
          "next": [
            145400013
          ]
        },
        "145400013": {
          "id": 145400013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1402,
          "text": "收起那些小心思吧，赛法利娅，你知道，这可瞒不过金线",
          "next": [
            145400014
          ]
        },
        "145400014": {
          "id": 145400014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1403,
          "text": "不许串通作弊！*我们*会当裁判，监督所有人的！",
          "next": [
            145400015
          ]
        },
        "145400015": {
          "id": 145400015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "既是裁判，又是选手，这样的安排何来公正可言？",
          "next": [
            145400016
          ]
        },
        "145400016": {
          "id": 145400016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1403,
          "text": "唔…缇宝来对战，缇宁做裁判，缇安抓坏蛋。嗯，这样就好！",
          "next": [
            145400017
          ]
        },
        "145400017": {
          "id": 145400017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1002,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}，这场奇美拉赛事，我也将全力以赴。",
          "next": [
            145400018,
            145400019
          ]
        },
        "145400018": {
          "id": 145400018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "认真起来的丹恒，想想都感觉强得可怕",
          "next": [
            145400020
          ]
        },
        "145400019": {
          "id": 145400019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "好啊，我也要拿出全部本事来应战！",
          "next": [
            145400020
          ]
        },
        "145400020": {
          "id": 145400020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "嘻，那就期待{NICKNAME}的精彩表现啦",
